<title>USA: Prudential wins Snohomish County, Wash., $39 mln.</title>
<headline>Prudential wins Snohomish County, Wash., $39 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc said it won $39 million of Snohomish County, Wash., limited tax general obligation bonds, 1997 Series A, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.36 percent.</p>
</text>
